  <item>
    <title>EP06 厌女文化的粉红炸弹|《大众文化的女性主义指南》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d24b1de924d4525a402b82</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d24b1de924d4525a402b82</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Mar 2025 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一档分享书籍、电影的播客，让我们从读书和观影开始，一起漫游更广阔的世界。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们一起来读《大众文化的女性主义指南》。我们根据自己感兴趣的内容，重新提炼了6个问题，希望通过相关讨论，剖析大众文化中的性别歧视和双重标准，一起解锁我们的实战指南。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>波波</span></p><span></span><p><span>Luna</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间线】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 聊聊为什么选这本书</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a> </span><strong><span>1.女性的劳动为何被贬低？女性的家务劳动为何被长久忽视？</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">09:12</a> 家务劳动是“以爱为名的剥削”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="791">13:11</a> </span><strong><span>2.女团在成长过程中，常有前辈说“年轻人只要能做自己喜欢的事情，哪怕再苦再累，也没有关系”，这种说法该怎么看？</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">16:42</a> 想要证明自己，想要追求梦想的念头，反而被利用</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">17:57</a> </span><strong><span>3.你怎么看，每当我们批判“女团被性对象化”时，就会有人说“你们不也喜欢看男人的腹肌吗”？</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1256">20:56</a> 对女性性感的定义，根本上是在寻找更无力的对象。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1366">22:46</a> </span><strong><span>4.姐姐们的3000万去哪里了？</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1517">25:17</a> 色情场所与整形、贷款产业环环相扣，瞄准了女性的身体。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> </span><strong><span>5.在女性群体对频道选择和节目内容的影响力越来越大的今天，为什么女性形象还是这么少？</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1905">31:45</a> 谈论女性主义对精英男性来说是装饰，但对女性来说却是枷锁</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2082">34:42</a>男性总是通过坚固的男性联盟，将女性排除在外。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2454">40:54</a></span><strong><span>6.你怎么看：大众文化不就是图一乐吗？何必如此认真？</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2547">42:27</a> 大众文化是个娱乐工业，跟意识形态密切相关</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期节目提到】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>韩国女性劳动者会的播客“乙们的驴耳”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>赵南柱，《82年生的金智英》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>上野千鹤子，《从零开始的女性主义》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>上野千鹤子，《无薪主妇》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>韩国综艺《跑男》《极限挑战》《懂也没用的神秘杂学词典》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>综艺《锵锵行天下》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>上野千鹤子，《厌女》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>李沧东，电影《燃烧》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>派蒂·杰金斯，电影《神奇女侠》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>尹丽川，电影《出走的决心》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>片尾曲：</span></strong><span>Everything I Wanted, by Billie Eilish</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67a0a2868419975c3bb9e5d0/ljvEW4SdXoqfnu4hpSP22UwpVhPR.m4a" length="46676315" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhEfHcFe9b6vjXr8DNMWGOZwgleJ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
