  <item>
    <title>EP05《身体从未忘记》|治愈的密码，身体会记得</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c580acb0167b8db931ff1d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c580acb0167b8db931ff1d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Mar 2025 10:20:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一档分享书籍、电影的播客，让我们从读书和观影开始，一起漫游更广阔的世界。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，</span><strong><span>我们关注创伤</span></strong><span>，一起来读《身体从未忘记：心理创伤疗愈中的大脑、心智和身体》。本期的</span><strong><span>主要内容</span></strong><span>包括：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>1. 创伤对身体、大脑和人际关系有怎样的影响？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>2. 在创伤中发生了什么？为什么会有创伤？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>3.我们如何面对创伤？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>只有理解创伤，才能找到治愈的密码。在节目的最后，我们也会和大家聊聊关于康复的原理和建议。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>波波</span></p><span></span><p><span>Luna</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间线】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a>本书概要与作者简介</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a>重新认识创伤：创伤其实就在日常生活中</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a>药物革命只是神话，结果喜忧参半</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a>创伤的机制、大脑的结构</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1697">28:17</a>创伤中大脑的两种状态：应激和麻木</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2111">35:11</a>童年的创伤，可能会决定我们成年后的行为</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2328">38:48</a>儿童的四种依恋方式</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2838">47:18</a>“不良童年经历”对健康影响的持续调查：ACE研究</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3061">51:01</a>对原生家庭的批评，是对父母的无情？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3232">53:52</a>两套记忆系统：普通记忆和创伤性记忆</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3606">1:00:06</a>私人or公共？为何创伤记忆的真实性总是受质疑？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4215">1:10:15</a>康复的两大原理：自上而下的方法和自下而上的方法</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【图像资料】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>大脑结构图：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkMMlETzqj34g6FmBRYUVjSI74Rl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>大脑的两条通路：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft0nX0grlTKS8GtfeUWFMKEhSBpl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>斯坦的大脑扫描图：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpks8Q1zmjoddBqaUl4DjP26GfFA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>乌特的大脑扫描图：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsv2lpQj6mG83y3zqj0HxAGZnjPE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><p><span>玛丽琳的家族肖像：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FquvQ7-nItD1MtpVkkXJDf5bDE_O.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期节目提到】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>PTSD，创伤后应激障碍</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>DSM,《精神障碍诊断与统计手册》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>TAT,主题统觉测试（Thematic Apperception Test）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>ACE,不良童年经历（Adverse Childhood Experience）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>韩江，《素食者》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>朱迪斯·赫尔曼，《创伤与复原》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>香奈儿·米勒，《知晓我姓名》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>林奕含，《房思琪的初恋乐园》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>伊藤诗织，《黑箱：日本之耻》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>米洛斯·福尔曼，电影《飞越疯人院》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>文晏，电影《嘉年华》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>汤姆·麦卡锡，电影《聚焦》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>片尾曲：</span></strong><span>Lost Stars, by Keira Knightley</span></p>]]></description>
