    <title>EP04 断亲以后怎样？塔拉的现状|《你当像鸟飞往你的山》（番外）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bb1a4005a90dfd0d4f38c0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bb1a4005a90dfd0d4f38c0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Feb 2025 15:00:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一档分享书籍、电影的播客，让我们从读书和观影开始，一起漫游更广阔的世界。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是一期很轻松的节目，我们来聊一聊在《你当像鸟飞往你的山》</span><strong><span>出版之后，发生了什么</span></strong><span>？对本书出版后造成的争议，塔拉的</span><strong><span>家人都有哪些反应</span></strong><span>？</span><strong><span>塔拉现在在做什么</span></strong><span>？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>波波</span></p><span></span><p><span>Luna</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间线】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a>塔拉的母亲也出版了自己的回忆录，《Educating》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a>一篇关于塔拉家庭的报道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a>哥哥泰勒对《你当像鸟飞往你的山》的评论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">14:44</a>如何理解回忆录的真实性与个人记忆的主观性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">19:18</a>塔拉现在在做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1398">23:18</a>扫兴父母、直升机父母和潜水艇父母</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期节目提到】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>巴塞尔·范德考克，《身体从未忘记：心理创伤疗愈中的大脑、心智和身体》</span></p><span></span><p><span>克瑙斯高，《我的奋斗》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="tarawestover.com"><span>塔拉的个人网站</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.deseret.com/indepth/2023/1/29/23575258/what-does-educated-tara-westover-family-think-about-reconciliation-book/#:~:text=In%20the%20Val%20and%20LaRee,education%2C%20hard%20work%20and%20faith" data-url="https://www.deseret.com/indepth/2023/1/29/23575258/what-does-educated-tara-westover-family-think-about-reconciliation-book/#:~:text=In%20the%20Val%20and%20LaRee,education%2C%20hard%20work%20and%20faith"><span>“她最不了解我”——在《educated》出版五年后，塔拉·韦斯特弗的家人渴望和解。这可能吗？</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrxPHkOwcYebr-bxfjEaERQdPzML.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl2WCvA0jvoiSa_FwZDazCvQ9Lmf.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FszQM5dCyv3xZVEkcggYO6x0Og2q.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhZl_5AacLV2b2Vw0RR714uG0B4q.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjnbjbQbqhSzGCOtbypAmO5GyMZ1.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
