  <item>
    <title>EP03 《哪吒之魔童闹海》：反叛发生在屏幕外</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b0892a05a90dfd0da65028</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b0892a05a90dfd0da65028</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Feb 2025 12:40:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好呀，欢迎来到</span><strong><span>漫游计划</span></strong><span>。这是一档分享书籍、电影的播客，让我们从读书和观影开始，一起漫游更广阔的世界。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们想聊聊《哪吒之魔童闹海》这部电影，它现在已经是一部现象级影片了。目前，它还在继续创造纪录，猫眼专业版预测内地总票房将超160亿，有望冲击全球动画电影票房冠军，让我们拭目以待。</span></p><span></span><p><span>对这部影片，我们想来聊一聊</span><strong><span>哪吒的形象和他的反抗</span></strong><span>，哪吒究竟在反什么？代表了怎样的精神？有着怎样的象征意义？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>波波</span></p><span></span><p><span>Luna</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间线】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a>观影感受（视效、节奏、情节）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">06:46</a>对屎尿屁梗的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="499">08:19</a>如何看待哪吒的反叛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">08:32</a>《哪吒之魔童降世》：反抗成见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">09:42</a>真的是反成见吗？他只是不接受成见加在自己身上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="699">11:39</a>反抗其实是在屏幕外完成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">14:13</a>哪吒二的内核无法从分析哪吒本身获得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a>《哪吒之魔童闹海》：反规则，反等级制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1146">19:06</a>不反父权的哪吒还是哪吒吗？哪吒如何演变为反抗的符号？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1372">22:52</a>《哪吒闹海》：一份个体的独立宣言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a>反抗的视觉化呈现：破鼎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1556">25:56</a>观众情绪的三个层次</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">28:24</a>破鼎之后，会建立新的世界吗？我们对哪吒三的期待</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期节目提到】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>饺子 电影《哪吒之魔童降世》《哪吒之魔童闹海》《打，打个大西瓜》</span></p><span></span><p><span>纪录片《不破不立》</span></p><span></span><p><span>亚里士多德 《诗学》</span></p><span></span><p><span>许仲琳 编 《封神演义》</span></p><span></span><p><span>王树忱 / 严定宪 / 徐景达 电影《哪吒闹海 》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hnzWHZlsFozyaAo7Me2tvA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hnzWHZlsFozyaAo7Me2tvA"><span>哪吒的真相：引燃封神战火的最惨工具人</span></a></p>]]></description>
